# The web app reads every setting from the repository's root .env in development and from the
# environment in production. See ../.env.example: DATABASE_URL, BETTER_AUTH_SECRET,
# BETTER_AUTH_URL, GITHUB_APP_SLUG, GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_ID, GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_SECRET,
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET, STRIPE_PRICE_* and STRIPE_METER_EVENT.
#
# It needs no URL for the Python services: it reads jobs from Postgres, and the worker picks up
# the jobs it writes.
